{"ID":"20240220132603-qwb7jsj","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132603-qwb7jsj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132603-qwb7jsj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171607-xbr4etv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171607-gstrf4i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171607-gstrf4i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:16,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:16\u0026#125;","title":"【半夏散】（半夏汤）","type":"doc","updated":"20240312171607"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312171607-xbr4etv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171607-xbr4etv","updated":"20240312171607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百二十七条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171607-s3miks6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171607-s3miks6","updated":"20240312171607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「少阴病」，咽中痛，「半夏散」及「汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171607-7kv6tj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171607-7kv6tj0","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏散及汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171607-w3hpwa0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171607-w3hpwa0","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏洗。桂枝去皮。甘草炙。以上各等分。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171607-kbse2kh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171607-kbse2kh","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"以上三味，各别捣筛已，合治之，白饮和服七寸匕，日三服，若不能散服者，以水一升，煎七沸，内散两方寸匕，更煎三沸，下火令小冷，少少咽之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171607-wkjczkg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171607-wkjczkg","updated":"20240312171607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这里炙半夏没有用，一定要用生半夏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。生半夏，本身甘草可以解半夏的毒，生姜也可以解半夏的毒。加上桂枝，很凶的。用散比较好。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果不能散服用汤剂给他吃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个是专门去喉咙痛。我讲的喉咙痛不是扁桃腺发炎，那是小题大做。你巴豆贝母是小题大做，巴豆贝母是到后来喉癌，才会用到的，这个喉咙生疮化脓的时候，整个喉咙发炎了，非常痛，可以用半夏散。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171607-7j6hjt8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171607-7j6hjt8","updated":"20240312171607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大部分吞不下东西的时候，我都用半夏苦酒汤，一般来说喉咙痛化脓发炎，还能吞东西我用半夏散。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171607-at4mv5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171607-at4mv5s","updated":"20240312171607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个下去喉咙发炎就去掉。生半夏去水，水是生万物的，喉咙老发炎生疮，喉咙里面有水在那边，病毒环境很好，生半夏下去，水没了，病毒跑了自然就好了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171607-gstrf4i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171607-gstrf4i","updated":"20240312171607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里炙半夏没效，一定要用生半夏。"}]}]}